allGradings -- add Grading to a Complex
***************************************

  * Usage: 
        Fall = allGradings(F,S)
  * Inputs:
      * F, a *note complex: (Complexes)Complex,, the free resolution of an
        ideal
      * S, a *note ring: (Macaulay2Doc)Ring,, a ring with a finer garding
  * Outputs:
      * Fall, a *note complex: (Complexes)Complex,, a complex over S, the same
        as F but now with homogeneous with respect to all gradings of S

Description
===========

Given a resolution F of an ideal, with carries additional homogeneity with
respect to the finer graded ring S, we compute the grading.

