degenerateK3BettiTables -- compute the Betti tables of a degenerate K3 over all prime fields
********************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        h = carpetBettiTables(a,b,e)
  * Inputs:
      * a, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the larger value, i.e a>=b
      * b, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the desired clifford index
