===================================================

  * "canonicalCarpet(...,FineGrading=>...)" -- see *note canonicalCarpet:
    canonicalCarpet, -- Carpet of given genus and Clifford index
  * "canonicalHomotopies(...,FineGrading=>...)" -- see *note
    canonicalHomotopies: canonicalHomotopies, -- Homotopies on the resolution
    of a K3 carpet
  * "carpet(...,FineGrading=>...)" -- see *note carpet: carpet, -- Ideal of the
    unique Gorenstein double structure on a 2-dimensional scroll

